{1 = 1-2}
9=1.	Say to @wPN{Enlil-massu}  
13=2.	what @wPN{Inim-Inana} says: 

{3 = 3-15}
17=3.	They told me everything and I am pleased beyond exaggeration. 
21=4.	May the precious protective power of a lifetime; 
25=5.	@wPN{Lugal-šu}, @wPN{Nabi-Enlil} and @wPN{Enlil-alsag}, the scholars who precede you; 
29=6.	and @wDN{Ninimma}, your own goddess, 
33=7.	and @wDN{Nisaba}, 
